e26b8d912fee7177e2ec5342c28157cf588b96a4c5052f9402b0755fee9426b1
Unchanged classes are copied from that exact 5.3 binary.
Changed classes were reconstructed and adapted; source is in this module.
Changes include Paper 26.3 networking/profiles, legacy data preservation,
Mojang and MineSkin V2 skin fetching, and server-thread/lifecycle handling.
Target: Paper 26.3 build 223, Java 25. Changes made 2026-10-26.

This is not an official upstream release. The proposed 5.4-SNAPSHOT version
is subject to maintainer review. Development and tests were AI-assisted.
